{"id": "a0a738ca-8c7a-4aee-abf8-4ab335568be5", "slug": "aura-core-cognitive-mapping", "title": "Aura Core - Cognitive Mapping", "description": "Core Cognitive UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Aura Core - Cognitive Mapping\"\ndescription: \"Core Cognitive UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#080808\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aura Core - Cognitive Mapping\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 9; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, navigation, flow, validation.\n## Overview\nCore Cognitive UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nAura Core Environment Alpha v1.2.0_rc Neural Network Memory Nodes Logic Gates Prompt Forge Analytics Pattern Recognition Data Synthesis Anomaly Detection Output Stage Render Pipeline Export Manifest Data Stream \"Ingesti…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Map your thoughts. Synthesize data. Generate reality..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #080808, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura Core - Cognitive Mapping</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        background: '#030303',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-background text-white/90 font-sans h-screen w-full overflow-hidden flex justify-center items-center relative selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Background Environment -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-[-5%] w-[110vw] h-[110vh] z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534638286233-72a8f7713614?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwzMnx8ZGFyayUyMGFic3RyYWN0fGVufDF8MHx8fDE3NzMzODMwMDV8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=3840&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; filter: blur(20px) brightness(0.15) saturate(1.1);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas for Lines -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-[5] pointer-events-none opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10 flex justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[100rem] h-full border-x border-white/[0.04] relative\">\n            <!-- Mini corner squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[-2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-[-2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[-2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-[-2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-[-2px] w-1 h-px bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 right-[-2px] w-1 h-px bg-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Top OS Bar -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-[100] flex items-center gap-6 py-2 px-6 rounded-full text-xs font-normal tracking-wide text-white/50\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(24px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n        <div class=\"text-white/90 flex items-center gap-2 font-medium\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n            Aura Core\n        </div>\n        <div>Environment Alpha</div>\n        <div class=\"font-mono text-white/30\">v1.2.0_rc</div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Workspace -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-20 w-full max-w-[100rem] h-full grid lg:grid-cols-[17rem_1fr_24rem] gap-8 pt-24 pb-10 px-6 lg:px-10 overflow-y-auto lg:overflow-hidden hide-scrollbar\" style=\"-ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;\">\n\n        <!-- Left Sidebar -->\n        <aside class=\"h-max flex flex-col gap-8 py-8 px-6 rounded-2xl float-element\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.005) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(24px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px); background-clip: padding-box; border: 1px solid transparent; border-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0.01)) 1;\">\n\n            <!-- Menu Section 1 -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/30 font-medium mb-1 pl-1\">\n                    <span>Neural Network</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 text-sm text-white/90 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-with-files-linear\" class=\"text-white/50 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Memory Nodes\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 pl-7 text-sm text-white/50 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xs -ml-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Logic Gates\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 pl-7 text-sm text-white/50 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-xs -ml-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Prompt Forge\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Menu Section 2 -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/30 font-medium mb-1 pl-1\">\n                    <span>Analytics</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 text-sm text-white/90 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-white/50 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Pattern Recognition\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 text-sm text-white/90 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-white/50 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Data Synthesis\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 text-sm text-white/90 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-warning-linear\" class=\"text-white/50 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Anomaly Detection\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Menu Section 3 -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mt-auto pt-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/30 font-medium mb-1 pl-1\">\n                    <span>Output Stage</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 text-sm text-white/90 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-white/50 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Render Pipeline\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 text-sm text-white/90 hover:bg-white/5 rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-white/50 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Export Manifest\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Center Stage -->\n        <section class=\"relative flex flex-col justify-center items-center min-h-[60vh] lg:min-h-full\">\n\n            <!-- Floating Nodes Cluster -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none hidden lg:block z-10\">\n                <!-- Node 1 -->\n                <div class=\"floating-card absolute p-4 rounded-xl w-56 flex flex-col gap-3 pointer-events-auto shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\" style=\"top: 15%; left: -5%; background: linear-gradient(#080808, #080808) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.65rem] text-white/50 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500\"></div> Data Stream\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90 line-clamp-3 font-light\">\n                        \"Ingesting raw telemetry from edge devices. Normalizing vector spaces for cognitive processing...\"\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/30 flex justify-between pt-2 border-t border-white/5 mt-1\">\n                        <span>sys_log</span><span>23ms</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Node 2 -->\n                <div class=\"floating-card absolute p-4 rounded-xl w-56 flex flex-col gap-3 pointer-events-auto shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\" style=\"bottom: 20%; left: 0%; background: linear-gradient(#080808, #080808) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; backdrop-filter: blur(16px); animation-delay: -3s;\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.65rem] text-white/50 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500\"></div> Synthesis\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90 line-clamp-3 font-light\">\n                        Cross-referencing behavioral patterns across 4 distinct datasets. Establishing consensus.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/30 flex justify-between pt-2 border-t border-white/5 mt-1\">\n                        <span>node_worker</span><span>Active</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Node 3 -->\n                <div class=\"floating-card absolute p-4 rounded-xl w-56 flex flex-col gap-3 pointer-events-auto shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\" style=\"top: 25%; right: -10%; background: linear-gradient(#080808, #080808) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; backdrop-filter: blur(16px); animation-delay: -7s;\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.65rem] text-white/50 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div> Artifact\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90 line-clamp-3 font-light\">\n                        Finalizing output matrix. Ready for human-in-the-loop validation sequence.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/30 flex justify-between pt-2 border-t border-white/5 mt-1\">\n                        <span>export_mgr</span><span>Ready</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Hero Content -->\n            <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl relative z-20 p-12 rounded-3xl\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6 inline-block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">\n                    <!-- Masked text spans inserted via JS -->\n                    <div class=\"masked-line overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"masked-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">Map</span> <span class=\"masked-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">your</span> <span class=\"masked-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">thoughts.</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"masked-line overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"masked-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">Synthesize</span> <span class=\"masked-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">data.</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"masked-line overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"masked-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">Generate</span> <span class=\"masked-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">reality.</span></div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-white/50 leading-relaxed mb-10 font-light max-w-lg mx-auto hero-subtext opacity-0\">\n                    Transform raw inputs into structured cognitive models.<br>\n                    Aura Core aligns your unstructured data into connected intelligence.\n                </p>\n\n                <button class=\"hero-btn opacity-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 px-6 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-white transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                    Deploy Environment\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Right Sidebar (Operations) -->\n        <aside class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 h-full py-6 lg:overflow-y-auto hide-scrollbar float-element-reverse\" style=\"-ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/30 after:content-[''] after:flex-grow after:h-px after:bg-gradient-to-r after:from-white/10 after:to-transparent mb-2\">\n                Pipeline Status\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                <!-- Step 1 -->\n                <div class=\"group p-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03]\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; hover:border-white/10;\">\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/30 mb-2\">01 — INGEST</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/90 mb-1\">Capture Data Streams</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-light\">Connect endpoints or drop unstructured files. Aura captures and tokenizes inputs instantly.</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Step 2 -->\n                <div class=\"group p-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03]\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; hover:border-white/10;\">\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/30 mb-2\">02 — PROCESS</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/90 mb-1\">Algorithmic Assembly</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-light\">Autonomous agents map relationships, detect anomalies, and structure knowledge graphs.</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Step 3 -->\n                <div class=\"group p-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03]\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; hover:border-white/10;\">\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/30 mb-2\">03 — OUTPUT</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/90 mb-1\">Execute Actions</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-light\">Deploy synthesized models into production formats, triggers, or formatted documents.</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"h-px bg-white/5 my-2\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/30 after:content-[''] after:flex-grow after:h-px after:bg-gradient-to-r after:from-white/10 after:to-transparent\">\n                I/O Stream\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- I/O Demo Box -->\n            <div class=\"mt-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col\" style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between py-2 px-3 text-[0.6rem] font-mono text-white/30 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                    <span>TASK: CLST-89</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">SYNCED</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" class=\"text-white/50\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-mono tracking-tight\">Init vector mapping...</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-center text-white/20\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-2 px-3 rounded-md text-xs text-white/90 border-l-2 border-emerald-500\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%);\">\n                            <span>Nodes Connected</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/50\">4,092</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-2 px-3 rounded-md text-xs text-white/90 border-l-2 border-emerald-500\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%);\">\n                            <span>Latency Offset</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-white/50\">12ms</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </aside>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Animations & WebGL -->\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Masked Reveal for Hero Text\n        gsap.to(\".masked-word\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.1,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            delay: 0.2\n        });\n\n        gsap.to(\".hero-subtext, .hero-btn\", {\n            opacity: 1,\n            y: 0,\n            duration: 1,\n            stagger: 0.2,\n            ease: \"power3.out\",\n            delay: 1,\n            startAt: { y: 20 }\n        });\n\n        // Floating Animations\n        gsap.to(\".float-element\", {\n            y: -10,\n            duration: 6,\n            ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n            yoyo: true,\n            repeat: -1\n        });\n\n        gsap.to(\".float-element-reverse\", {\n            y: 10,\n            duration: 7,\n            ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n            yoyo: true,\n            repeat: -1\n        });\n\n        gsap.utils.toArray('.floating-card').forEach((card, i) => {\n            gsap.to(card, {\n                y: () => (i % 2 === 0 ? -15 : 15),\n                x: () => (i % 2 === 0 ? 5 : -5),\n                rotationZ: () => (i % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1),\n                duration: 8 + i * 2,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                delay: i * -2\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- WebGL Line Animation ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n        const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { antialias: true, alpha: true });\n\n        if (gl) {\n            let width, height;\n            const resize = () => {\n                width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, width, height);\n            };\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            // Shaders\n            const vsSource = `\n                attribute vec2 a_position;\n                attribute float a_alpha;\n                varying float v_alpha;\n                void main() {\n                    gl_Position = vec4(a_position, 0.0, 1.0);\n                    v_alpha = a_alpha;\n                }\n            `;\n            const fsSource = `\n                precision mediump float;\n                varying float v_alpha;\n                void main() {\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(1.0, 1.0, 1.0, v_alpha * 0.15);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const compileShader = (type, source) => {\n                const shader = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(shader, source);\n                gl.compileShader(shader);\n                return shader;\n            };\n\n            const program = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(program, compileShader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vsSource));\n            gl.attachShader(program, compileShader(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fsSource));\n            gl.linkProgram(program);\n            gl.useProgram(program);\n\n            const positionLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(program, \"a_position\");\n            const alphaLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(program, \"a_alpha\");\n\n            const buffer = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buffer);\n\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(positionLoc);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(positionLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 12, 0);\n\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(alphaLoc);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(alphaLoc, 1, gl.FLOAT, false, 12, 8);\n\n            gl.enable(gl.BLEND);\n            gl.blendFunc(gl.SRC_ALPHA, gl.ONE);\n\n            // Particle Setup\n            const numParticles = 80;\n            const maxDistance = 250;\n            const particles = Array.from({length: numParticles}, () => ({\n                x: Math.random() * width,\n                y: Math.random() * height,\n                vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5,\n                vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5\n            }));\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const render = () => {\n                gl.clearColor(0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0);\n                gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\n\n                const vertices = [];\n\n                // Update positions\n                for (let i = 0; i < numParticles; i++) {\n                    let p = particles[i];\n                    p.x += p.vx;\n                    p.y += p.vy;\n\n                    if (p.x < 0 || p.x > width) p.vx *= -1;\n                    if (p.y < 0 || p.y > height) p.vy *= -1;\n\n                    // Connect lines\n                    for (let j = i + 1; j < numParticles; j++) {\n                        let p2 = particles[j];\n                        let dx = p.x - p2.x;\n                        let dy = p.y - p2.y;\n                        let dist = Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy);\n\n                        if (dist < maxDistance) {\n                            let alpha = 1.0 - (dist / maxDistance);\n                            // Normalize to WebGL coordinates (-1 to 1)\n                            let x1 = (p.x / width) * 2 - 1;\n                            let y1 = (p.y / height) * -2 + 1;\n                            let x2 = (p2.x / width) * 2 - 1;\n                            let y2 = (p2.y / height) * -2 + 1;\n\n                            vertices.push(\n                                x1, y1, alpha,\n                                x2, y2, alpha\n                            );\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (vertices.length > 0) {\n                    gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array(vertices), gl.DYNAMIC_DRAW);\n                    gl.drawArrays(gl.LINES, 0, vertices.length / 3);\n                }\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            };\n\n            render();\n        }\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-core-cognitive-mapping.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-core-cognitive-mapping.jpg", "source_name": "aura-core-cognitive-mapping-DESIGN.md", "views": 102, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T11:15:34.128221+00:00"}